      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "> anyone had it running on arm cpu? (aarch64 for the container)\n\nYes. I built one named [`BitNet-Stack`](https://github.com/stackblogger/BitNet-Stack) that runs on aarch64 CPU. It provides a web UI to interact with BitNet and streams the response word by word, similar to ChatGPT.\n\nIt provides one single Docker command to run the LLM and UI. It supports conversational response. You can chat with the LLM where it remembers the context. ",
